j/thumb/a/a3/668mjtdoaawwphbynbw2ble0ltw8867.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%A2%9E%E5%B9%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a3/668mjtdoaawwphbynbw2ble0ltw8867.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%A2%9E%E5%B9%85.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a3/668mjtdoaawwphbynbw2ble0ltw8867.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />攻击增幅\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）使目标范围内所有己方，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]，免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"攻击属性减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">攻击属性减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-2 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/2d/hfowgec58sum0uhhp81qjm2mpqqsot3.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E